<title>UK: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP COLLATED RESULTS/SCORES.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP COLLATED RESULTS/SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>results and latest scores in</p>
<p>Davis Cup tennis matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group one play-off</p>
<p>In Kiev:Britain beat Ukraine 3-2</p>
<p>American group one play-offs</p>
<p>In Nassau: Bahamas and Venezuela level 2-2</p>
<p>In Buenos Aires: Ecuador lead Argentina 2-1, play suspended</p>
<p>until Monday due to rain.</p>
<p>Asia/Oceania group one play-off</p>
<p>In Tashkent: Japan beat Uzbekistan 3-2</p>
<p>In Nova Gorica: Norway beat Slovenia 4-1</p>
<p>In Porto: Portugal and Yogoslavia level 2-2</p>
<p>In Bytom: Poland beat Ivory Coast 4-1</p>
<p>In Tampere: Finland beat Belarus 3-2</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group one play-offs</p>
<p>In Tbilisi: Georgia lead Nigeria 3-0, play abandoned due to</p>
<p>rain, match resumes Monday.</p>
<p>In Cairo: Egypt and Lithuania level 2-2, play suspended due to</p>
<p>bad light, match resumes Monday.</p>
<p>In Jurmala: Latvia beat Ghana 4-1</p>
<p>In Dublin: Ireland beat Greece 4-1</p>
</text>
